flowchart TD
    A[Staff opens mobile issue form] --> B[Check or scan approved borrower ID]
    B --> C[Scan or enter book code]
    C --> D{Required data valid and eligible?}
    D -- No --> E[Show correction or policy reason]
    E --> C
    D -- Yes --> F[Calculate due date from approved policy]
    F --> G[Staff confirms issue]
    G --> H[Save ISSUED record and audit event]
    H --> I[Show or print due date]
    H --> J[Attempt approved reminder]
    J --> K{Reminder succeeds?}
    K -- Yes --> L[Reminder recorded]
    K -- No --> M[Log failure; receipt/manual fallback]
    I --> N[Return recorded by staff]
    N --> O[Status RETURNED]
